claim.claim-text:
a hollow catheter (12);
a catheter hub (14) configured to fix and hold the catheter (12);
an inner needle (16) including a needlepoint (16a) and configured to be detachably inserted through the inside of the catheter (12);
a needle hub (18, 204, 310) configured to fix and hold the inner needle (16); and
a catheter operation member (20, 202, 302) capable of moving the catheter (12) relative to the inner needle (16) in a longitudinal direction,
wherein the catheter operation member (20, 202, 302) has a slit (214a, 304c) that extends longitudinally, and the catheter operation member (20, 202, 302) is configured to support the catheter (12) from below,
wherein the catheter operation member (20, 202, 302) includes a holding portion (58, 222, 308) configured to directly hold the catheter (12) in a detachable manner,
and the catheter (12) is placed on the top or bottom side of the catheter operation member (20, 202, 302) and the holding portion (58, 222, 308) supports the catheter (12) from below.
